Subject: [PATCH 421/423] Command line: --colors for the parts of pictures,
 drawings and the web view

--colors 'Frame*=#808080;Screw*=200,40,40' or a JSON file {pattern: colour}
colours the parts whose label or name matches (* and ?; a later pattern
wins) in --render, --export-svg, --export-polygons, --export-pptx and
--export-web. Colours as #rrggbb or r,g,b (0..1, or 0..255).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
